---
import Content from "../../layouts/en/Content.astro";
import title from "../../assets/title.webp";
import tools from "../../assets/tools.webp";
---

<Content titleImage={title}>
  <div id="about-text">
    <p>
      Yu-la salon is a Japanese and International Hairdresser located in
      London's Putney. We provide great hair services in a relaxing and
      refreshing atmosphere.
    </p>
    <p>
      Yu-la offers beautiful styling, hair cutting, colouring and Straightening
      Perm services for male and female - using specially imported products from
      Japan.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are proud of our hair care and unique customer service to make sure all
      the clients are satisfied and feel fantastic.
    </p>
    <p>
      In Yu-la, we offer you the ultimate hairdressing experiences just perfect
      for you.
    </p>
    <p>We are looking forward to your visit.</p>
    <img src={tools.src} width="320px" alt="img" />
  </div>
</Content>

<style>
  #about-text {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-align: center;

    img {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
